---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy | Knowletive" description="Knowletive privacy policy detailing how we protect and handle your personal information.">
  <section class="relative page-header-spacing pb-10 md:pb-12 bg-[#072B6F] text-white">
    <div class="container-custom text-center">
      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-manrope font-extrabold mb-4">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-blue-100 text-sm md:text-base">Last updated: January 2026</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-padding bg-white">
    <div class="container-custom max-w-4xl text-[#0B1F3A] leading-relaxed space-y-8">
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-3 text-[#072B6F]">1. Introduction</h2>
        <p class="text-[#64748B]">Knowletive ("we," "our," or "us") respects your privacy and is committed to protecting the personal information you share with us when visiting our website (knowletive.com), enrolling in our programs, or requesting our consulting services.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-3 text-[#072B6F]">2. Information We Collect</h2>
        <p class="text-[#64748B] mb-2">We may collect personal information that you voluntarily provide when filling out forms or contacting us, including:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-[#64748B] space-y-1">
          <li>Full name and contact details (email address, phone number).</li>
          <li>Academic background, degree, graduation year, and career interests.</li>
          <li>Inquiries regarding courses, PEP enrollment, or consulting services.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-3 text-[#072B6F]">3. How We Use Your Information</h2>
        <p class="text-[#64748B] mb-2">We use the collected information solely to:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-[#64748B] space-y-1">
          <li>Provide academic counseling, course syllabus downloads, and consultation calls.</li>
          <li>Process applications for the PEP Program and technical training batches.</li>
          <li>Communicate updates regarding upcoming batches, CET 2026 dates, and placement drives.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-3 text-[#072B6F]">4. Data Protection & Sharing</h2>
        <p class="text-[#64748B]">We implement industry-standard security safeguards. We do not sell, rent, or trade your personal information to third-party advertisers. Information is only shared with authorized hiring partners with your explicit consent during placement activities.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-3 text-[#072B6F]">5. Contact Us</h2>
        <p class="text-[#64748B]">For questions regarding this Privacy Policy, please contact us at <a href="mailto:info@knowletive.com" class="text-[#0878E8] font-semibold underline">info@knowletive.com</a> or visit our office in Baner, Pune, Maharashtra.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
